  "published": "2026-05-17T17:22:56.453Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Pipeline-Oriented Architecture: Unified Serialization, Compression, and Security into a cohesive Codec stack.\n- High-Performance Framing: Integrated DataFrames and FragmentAssembler for reliable large-packet handling.\n- Advanced Cryptography: Hardened AEAD engines (ChaCha20Poly1305/Salsa20Poly1305) and X25519 handshake logic.\n- Optimized Serialization: Refined LiteSerializer with source-generated codecs for complex types and fast unmanaged paths.\n- Efficient Compression: Integrated LZ4 block encoders with custom memory pool support to minimize GC pressure.",
